OL,3,GNEWSANissan announces #170m investment
OL,4,Ain UK plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FCar manufacturer Nissan has announced
OL,7,Fplans for a new model in Europe and
OL,8,F#170m investment to build it at its
OL,9,Fplant in Sunderland.
OL,11,FThe second generation Nissan Kicks is a
OL,12,Fhybrid electric vehicle which is
OL,13,Fcurrently built in Japan, Mexico and
OL,14,FBrazil.
OL,16,FIt will be built alongside its Qashqai,
OL,17,FJuke and Leaf models at the Wearside
OL,18,Ffactory. The Japanese firm said the
OL,19,Fplan would not create new jobs or
OL,20,Fchange shift patterns but it would help
OL,21,Fsafeguard existing roles.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
