OL,3,GNEWSANissan announces #170m investment
OL,4,Ain UK plant
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness Secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,7,Fsaid the announcement was a "huge vote
OL,8,Fof confidence in the UK's manufacturing
OL,9,Fexpertise and automotive future".
